  "description": "Should we have sold Roblox yesterday? Maybe...",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to a<strong> 🔒 subscriber-only post🔒 </strong></em>Today we discuss “When to Sell”… subtle clues that may indicate the end of a run. To be honest, there isn’t a perfect methodology…but a consistent, repeatable methodology is important. What got me to click sell on <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RBLX&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> yesterday? We also take a closer look at <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RGTI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> a bit closer, a stock that originally showed up on the StockTok Screener back on 22 May and <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$MP&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>  which has been popping its head back up again.</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTokDashboard</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a> </strong></em></p><p>Update 7/17 below</p>",
